DEPRECATION CANDIDATE — synthesis by reconciliation.

Works mechanically (item 20): the trigger carries the whole family, the evidence
and the readings arrive unasked, the verb composes and supersedes reversibly.
`llama3.1:8b` cannot do the task. Two briefs -- "the sense the readings add up
to" and "write the definition from the concordance, not a summary of the
readings" -- both produced the readings concatenated.

Superseded in the proposed design by *defining the word once*, from the trace and
the concordance, rather than reconciling N readings after the fact. Reconciliation
is the one shape this model reliably fails; see also `glossary.same`.
